==Strategy==
Before spawning [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Newtone]], take care with the two Haniwanwans, since their Mini-Waves can snipe him from a distance. Spawn Newtone, protect him with cats like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]], and appropriate meatshields. Time [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] to kill Shachiko when they spawn.

